# The immovable reference: md5 of projekt/<p>/www8051.rom inside tb/base.7z.
#
# Anchored to the ORIGINAL inputs - the 2001 sources and lib/www51.sc with
# *(reset_network) live, as gnu13 shipped it - built by the ported toolchain.
# make check verifies the shipped ROMs against this list before using them,
# so no repack of base.7z can move the reference without changing this file
# in the same commit, where the diff is visible.
#
# The relation of these images to the 2001 binaries is pinned separately:
# make oracle explains every differing byte against the untouched
# projekt/*/www8051.hex, and tb/frozen.expect records the 2.11.2 rebuild.
